                <pb facs="0022" n="15" sameAs="frus:frus1894Nicaragua/pg15"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 7.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Straus to Mr. Guzman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-02"><hi rendition="#italic">March 2,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>British war ship <hi rendition="#italic">Cleopatra</hi> landed armed force
                    Bluefields, compelling Nicaraguans to raise state of siege. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Cleopatra</hi> returned Jamaica. British soldiers
                    remained.</p>
            </div>
